agentify-laya bundles code under MIT (see LICENSE).

Model weights:
- Laya weights are published by Convai Innovations under Apache 2.0.
- This repo does not ship weights. On first run they are downloaded
  from Hugging Face repo receptron/laya-onnx (~1.7 GB fp32) and cached
  locally. See README for LAYA_CACHE and revision pinning.

Upstream:
- Laya Node library by receptron, MIT:
  https://github.com/receptron/laya
- Laya checkpoint by Convai Innovations:
  https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya
